le.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"esfxpolbe4k":{"lh_a168_title":"Why Subscription Matters","lh_a168_desc_html":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><\/div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\">Traditional art is a one-time purchase. It fades, it dates, and it\nquickly becomes invisible.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\"><br><b>\nDECORIS is different<\/b>. With our subscription service, you\ndecide how often your images change. Every delivery brings a\nnew story, keeping your space inspiring and current without the\nhassle of buying again and again.<\/span><\/div><!--lh-live-editor-->"},"wke5l51zr9s":{"lh_hnlpsm_title":"What Makes DECORIS Different","lh_hnlpsm_desc_html":"<b>100% Original Photography<\/b> \u2013 never stock,\nnever AI. Every image is captured by our global\nteam of photographers.<br><br><b>\n\nFramed and Ready<\/b> \u2013 choose your size and\nframe color; your first image arrives ready to\nhang.<br><br><b>\n\nDynamic Image Refresh<\/b> \u2013 you select new\nimages when it suits you or we can select them\nfor you based upon your initial preferences.<br><br><b>\n\nSimplicity<\/b> \u2013 When your new images arrive you\nsimply unroll into the back of your frames.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"1qjbxh7pwsu":{"lh_a168_title":"For Every Customer","lh_a168_desc_html":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px;\">Residents &amp; Homeowners<\/b><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\"> \u2013 elevate your\nliving space with artwork that grows with you.<\/span><br><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><\/div><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px;\">\n\nGift Buyers<\/b><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0px;\"> \u2013 give a subscription that keeps\ndelivering joy long after the occasion.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><br><\/b><\/div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0px;\">Businesses &amp; Facilities<\/b><span style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0px;\"> \u2013 keep\nenvironments dynamic, professional, and\nbrand-aligned.<\/span><\/div><!--lh-live-editor-->"},"ttvinc9vak":{"lh_hnlpsm_title":"Get Started Today","lh_hnlpsm_desc_html":"Transform your walls into a living gallery. With\n<b>DECORIS<\/b>, you\u2019re not just decorating\u2014you\u2019re\nsubscribing to an experience that evolves with\nyou:<br><br>\n\n\u2714 Choose your image<br>\n\u2714 Pick your frame size and color<br>\n\u2714 Select your subscription plan<br>\n\u2714 Enjoy effortless image refreshes, delivered\nto your door<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"4offhsz7qsp":{"lh_a168_title_html":"DECORIS is more than artwork\u2014it\u2019s a <br>subscription to beauty, elegance, and inspiration","lh_a168_desc_html":"<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_8huk_link_html":"<a href=\"\/pages\/about\" data-ga-action=\"btn_link\" data-ga-label=\"Button\" data-lhlink>Get Started<\/a>"}}},"name":"index page"}
